-- The entry names the sections a rule is declared under, not the file: two
-- imported files that each declare `scaled` under `§ Pricing` give one entry
-- (overnight card O6, 2026-10-11; found in review). The rows answer 30, 50 and
-- 80, and every one lists `WITH Pricing.scaled: rate`.

IMPORT `batch-typically-collide-secimport-a`
IMPORT `batch-typically-collide-secimport-b`

@export default Combine
GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
      one IS A BOOLEAN
      two IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE combine IS (IF one THEN useOne n ELSE 0) PLUS (IF two THEN useTwo n ELSE 0)
